        }
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "`pd.read_csv()` reads a CSV file straight into a dataframe, and `.head(10)` shows us the first 10 rows (just `.head()` shows 5).\n",
        "\n",
        "We can check the size of the dataframe with `.shape`, which gives us (rows, columns):"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "rFdC3a1m2K_6"
      }
    },
    {
